SUMMARY:Triangle Mutual Aid Comms Meetup
DESCRIPTION:Splat Space - Durham's Hackerspace\nSplat Space will be hostin
 g the TMA comms group monthly meeting this is a space for the radio curiou
 s to learn about radio licensing and emergency communications.\n\nThis eve
 nt is open to the public.\n\\*no registration required\\*
